  CHG --> JSON[JSON Format]
  CHG --> SQL[SQL Format]
  LIQUIBASE --> CS[Changesets]
  CS --> AUT[Author / ID]
  CS --> TAG[Tagging]
  CS --> ROLL[Rollback]
  LIQUIBASE --> CTX[Contexts / Labels]

  MIG --> TOOLS[Tool Comparison]
